\answer{Factored log-likelihood is underspecified, so that directly trying to learn skills from log-likelihood does not result in "good" (temporally-extended) skills}
\question{What are the technical challenges that motivated this paper?}
\answer{How can we learn skills that are semantically meaningful / temporally extended from offline data}
}

